{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":60,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Arise! Shine! For your light has come, And the glory of Jehovah has risen upon you.","tok":[{"t":"Arise","s":["H6965"],"a":[0]},{"t":"! "},{"t":"Shine","s":["H0215"],"a":[1]},{"t":"! For your "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[4]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"risen","s":["H2224"],"a":[8]},{"t":" upon you."}]},{"n":2,"text":"For, behold, the darkness will cover the earth, And deep darkness the peoples; But Jehovah will rise upon you, And His glory will be seen upon you.","tok":[{"t":"For, behold, the "},{"t":"darkness","s":["H2822"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"cover","s":["H3680"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And deep "},{"t":"darkness","s":["H6205"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H3816"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; But "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" will rise upon you, And His "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[10]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[12]},{"t":" upon you."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And nations will come to your light, And kings to the brightness of your rising.","tok":[{"t":"And nations will "},{"t":"come","s":["H1980"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to your "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"brightness","s":["H5051"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"rising","s":["H2225"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Lift up your eyes around you and see: They all gather together; they come to you; Your sons will come from far away, And your daughters will be carried on the hip.","tok":[{"t":"Lift "},{"t":"up","s":["H5375"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[2]},{"t":" around you and "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[3]},{"t":": They all gather "},{"t":"together","s":["H6908"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; they "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to you; Your "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[8]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[10]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"far","s":["H7350"],"a":[9]},{"t":" away, And your "},{"t":"daughters","s":["H1323"],"a":[11]},{"t":" will be carried on the hip."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Then you will see and you will beam, And your heart will be in awe and will swell with joy, For the abundance of the sea will be turned to you, The wealth of the nations will come to you.","tok":[{"t":"Then you will "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and you will beam, And your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will be in awe and will swell with joy, For the "},{"t":"abundance","s":["H1995"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[10]},{"t":" will be turned to you, The wealth of the nations will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[13]},{"t":" to you."}]},{"n":6,"text":"A multitude of camels will cover you, The young camels of Midian and Ephah; All those from Sheba will come; They will carry gold and frankincense, And they will bear the good news of Jehovah’s praises.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H8229"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"camels","s":["H1581"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"cover","s":["H3680"],"a":[2]},{"t":" you, The young camels of "},{"t":"Midian","s":["H4080"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Ephah","s":["H5891"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; All those from "},{"t":"Sheba","s":["H7614"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; They will carry "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and frankincense, And they will bear the good news of Jehovah’s "},{"t":"praises","s":["H8416"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"All the flocks of Kedar will be gathered together to you; The rams of Nebaioth will minister to you; They will go up acceptably upon My altar, And I will beautify the house of My beauty.","tok":[{"t":"All the "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H6629"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Kedar","s":["H6938"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be gathered "},{"t":"together","s":["H6908"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to you; The "},{"t":"rams","s":["H0352"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Nebaioth","s":["H5032"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"minister","s":["H8334"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to you; They will go "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[8]},{"t":" acceptably upon My "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[11]},{"t":", And I will beautify the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of My beauty."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Who are these who fly like a cloud, And like the doves to their dovecote?","tok":[{"t":"Who are these who "},{"t":"fly","s":["H5774"],"a":[3]},{"t":" like a "},{"t":"cloud","s":["H5645"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And like the "},{"t":"doves","s":["H3123"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to their dovecote?"}]},{"n":9,"text":"Surely the coastlands will look eagerly for Me; And the ships of Tarshish will come first, To bring your children from afar, Their silver and their gold with them, Unto the name of Jehovah your God And unto the Holy One of Israel; for He has beautified you.","tok":[{"t":"Surely the coastlands will look eagerly for Me; And the "},{"t":"ships","s":["H0591"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Tarshish","s":["H8659"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will come "},{"t":"first","s":["H7223"],"a":[6]},{"t":", To "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[7]},{"t":" your children from afar, Their "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and their "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[11]},{"t":" with them, Unto the "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[14]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[15]},{"t":" And unto the Holy "},{"t":"One","s":["H6918"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[17]},{"t":"; for He has beautified you."}]},{"n":10,"text":"And the children of foreigners will build up your walls, And their kings will minister to you; For in My wrath I struck you, But in My favor I had compassion on you.","tok":[{"t":"And the children of foreigners will build "},{"t":"up","s":["H1129"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"walls","s":["H2346"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And their "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"minister","s":["H8334"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to you; For in My "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H7110"],"a":[7]},{"t":" I struck you, But in My favor I had compassion on you."}]},{"n":11,"text":"And your gates will be open continually; They will not be closed day or night, So that they may bring to you the wealth of the nations And their kings being led in procession.","tok":[{"t":"And your "},{"t":"gates","s":["H8179"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"open","s":["H6605"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"continually","s":["H8548"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; They will not be closed "},{"t":"day","s":["H3119"],"a":[3]},{"t":" or "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[4]},{"t":", So that they may "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to you the wealth of the nations And their "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[11]},{"t":" being led in procession."}]},{"n":12,"text":"For the nation and the kingdom that will not serve you will perish, and the nations will be utterly wasted.","tok":[{"t":"For the "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"kingdom","s":["H4467"],"a":[2]},{"t":" that will not "},{"t":"serve","s":["H5647"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you will "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"utterly","s":["H2717"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wasted","s":["H2717"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"The glory of Lebanon will come to you, The fir tree, the pine tree, and the box tree together, To beautify the place of My sanctuary; And I will make the place for My feet glorious.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Lebanon","s":["H3844"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to you, The fir "},{"t":"tree","s":["H1265"],"a":[4]},{"t":", the pine "},{"t":"tree","s":["H8410"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"box","s":["H8391"],"a":[6]},{"t":" tree "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[7]},{"t":", To "},{"t":"beautify","s":["H6286"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of My "},{"t":"sanctuary","s":["H4720"],"a":[10]},{"t":"; And I will make the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[11]},{"t":" for My "},{"t":"feet","s":["H7272"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"glorious","s":["H3513"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And the sons of those who afflicted you Will come bowing down to you, And all those who despised you will bow down At the soles of your feet; And they will call you the City of Jehovah, The Zion of the Holy One of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of those who "},{"t":"afflicted","s":["H6031"],"a":[4]},{"t":" you Will "},{"t":"come","s":["H1980"],"a":[0]},{"t":" bowing down to you, And all those who "},{"t":"despised","s":["H5006"],"a":[10]},{"t":" you will bow "},{"t":"down","s":["H7812"],"a":[5]},{"t":" At the "},{"t":"soles","s":["H3709"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"feet","s":["H7272"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; And they will "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[11]},{"t":" you the "},{"t":"City","s":["H5892"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[14]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of the Holy "},{"t":"One","s":["H6918"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Whereas you have been forsaken and hated, So that no one would pass through you, I will make you an eternal excellency, A joy from generation to generation.","tok":[{"t":"Whereas","s":["H8478"],"a":[0]},{"t":" you have been "},{"t":"forsaken","s":["H5800"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"hated","s":["H8130"],"a":[3]},{"t":", So that no one would pass "},{"t":"through","s":["H5674"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you, I will "},{"t":"make","s":["H7760"],"a":[6]},{"t":" you an "},{"t":"eternal","s":["H5769"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"excellency","s":["H1347"],"a":[7]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"joy","s":["H4885"],"a":[9]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"And you will suck the milk of nations And suck the breast of kings; Thus you will know that I, Jehovah, am your Savior And your Redeemer, the Mighty One of Jacob.","tok":[{"t":"And you will "},{"t":"suck","s":["H3243"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"milk","s":["H2461"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"suck","s":["H3243"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"breast","s":["H7699"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; Thus you will "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[6]},{"t":" that I, "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", am your Savior And your "},{"t":"Redeemer","s":["H1350"],"a":[11]},{"t":", the Mighty "},{"t":"One","s":["H0046"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Instead of bronze I will bring gold, And instead of iron I will bring silver; And instead of wood there will be bronze, And instead of stones there will be iron; And I will make peace your officers, And righteousness your rulers.","tok":[{"t":"Instead of bronze I will "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And instead of "},{"t":"iron","s":["H1270"],"a":[5]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; And instead of "},{"t":"wood","s":["H6086"],"a":[9]},{"t":" there will be bronze, And instead of "},{"t":"stones","s":["H0068"],"a":[12]},{"t":" there will be "},{"t":"iron","s":["H1270"],"a":[13]},{"t":"; And I will "},{"t":"make","s":["H7760"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[16]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"officers","s":["H6486"],"a":[15]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[18]},{"t":" your rulers."}]},{"n":18,"text":"Violence will no